#Life 1.05
#N Gosper glider gun
#D THE pattern that proved Conway wrong: he conjectured no pattern could
#D grow forever, and Bill Gosper's gun (1970) disproved it by firing a
#D new glider every 30 generations, indefinitely.
#D Note: its bounding box is 36 columns wide, wider than this app's
#D 30-column board, so it will be clipped on the right and will not
#D fire correctly here - included anyway as the single most famous
#D pattern in the Game of Life's history.
#P 0 0
